; preludes: form-stdlib/evidence-grounding.fk
;
; zero-point-ladder-band — the ladder's lanes COMPUTED and asserted, not typed.
;
; The companion page (docs/vision-kb/resources/zero-point-plasma-water.md in Coherence-Network)
; walks from a quantum harmonic oscillator to the "water car". Its first version carried
; hand-typed lane tags beside a classifier already proven four-way — an epistemic ladder whose
; own lanes were asserted rather than run. This band closes that: every claim is a tuple here,
; eg-lane decides the lane, and the page reports what the spectrum SAYS.
;
; A hand-typed lane is the exact failure the lane discipline exists to catch: an author grading
; their own claim. Running the claims means the author can be surprised — and was.
;
; A claim = (name observed? independent? measured? derived? refuted?) — see evidence-grounding.fk.
;
; Ground: Misner-Thorne-Wheeler, Gravitation (1973), read directly at 43.4 pp. 1190-1195 and
; 44.2-44.3 pp. 1200-1203; Cole & Puthoff, Phys. Rev. E 48, 1562 (1993); Lamoreaux, Phys. Rev.
; Lett. 78, 5 (1997); Prigogine's 1977 Nobel; Bostick's plasmoids; Mesyats' ectons; Shoulders'
; EV/EVO patents; the Brown's-gas and water-car reports; Adamenko's Proton-21; LeClair's
; cavitation crystals; the cosmological constant problem.
;
; WHY THE TABLE LIVES IN THE BAND rather than a sibling recipe: the fourth arm resolves a
; three-file prelude chain (core + module + band). At four files the earliest module is dropped —
; measured here, not assumed: with core+evidence-grounding+zero-point-ladder+band, fkwu returned
; the claim table intact (22 claims, 6 fields, correct values) while every eg-lane call came back
; 0, including on a claim built inline in the band. The same eg-lane calls return 5 / 4 / 1
; correctly at three files. So the walk is built over the minimal proven core, in one module.
;
; Vocabulary is held to exactly what evidence-grounding.fk uses and proves: add / eq / ge / head /
; if / len / list / nth / tail. No cons, no empty, no nil?, no higher-order map — fourth-shim.fk
; carries no cons/empty, so anything that CONSTRUCTS a list returns nothing on the fourth arm
; while the three walkers return it. Nothing below builds a list except a `list` literal.
;
; WHAT THE ENGINE CORRECTED IN THE HAND-TAGGED PAGE — the reason this band exists:
;   The page had tagged the plasma-water mechanism and the cavitation/transmutation tributaries
;   CONTESTED wholesale. Only "water-car" computes to CONTESTED — the one claim with a real
;   history of attempted and failed replication. The mechanism, the Brown's-gas tungsten report,
;   the EVO-as-vacuum-object reading and crater transmutation land in INFERENCE: single-source
;   and unreplicated, which is weaker than measured but is NOT evidence against. The hand-tags
;   were harsher than the evidence.
;   It also splits two rungs the page had flattened: Prigogine's conditions are MEASURED while
;   the orthogonal flux resting on them is INFERENCE, and plasmoids/ectons are MEASURED while
;   the EVO vacuum reading is INFERENCE.
;   And PRACTICE comes back 0 — across twenty-two claims the ladder holds no phenomenology at
;   all, which is what a physics ladder should look like and was invisible before counting.
;
; The computed walk, in claim order:
;   5 4 5 5 4 4 4 4 4 5 4 5 2 2 5 2 2 1 2 5 2 0
; Profile (measured theory practice inference contested mystery) = 7 7 0 6 1 1
; Surface = 14 grow tissue, 8 held below.
;
; Verdict 65535 when every computed lane lands:
;      1  oscillator-zpe MEASURED          256  orthogonal-flux INFERENCE
;      2  lamb-shift MEASURED              512  water-shell-mechanism INFERENCE
;      4  casimir-force MEASURED          1024  water-car CONTESTED
;      8  mtw-1e94 THEORY                 2048  crater-transmutation INFERENCE
;     16  cole-puthoff THEORY             4096  fractoemission MEASURED
;     32  quantum-foam THEORY             8192  suppression-thesis MYSTERY
;     64  cosmological-constant MEASURED 16384  profile 7 7 0 6 1 1
;    128  prigogine-conditions MEASURED  32768  surface 14 grown 8 held
(do
    (defn zpl-claims ()
        (list
            (list "oscillator-zpe"        1 1 1 0 0)
            (list "field-as-oscillators"  0 0 0 1 0)
            (list "lamb-shift"            1 1 1 0 0)
            (list "casimir-force"         1 1 1 0 0)
            (list "fluctuation-scaling"   0 0 0 1 0)
            (list "quantum-foam"          0 0 0 1 0)
            (list "charge-as-topology"    0 0 0 1 0)
            (list "mtw-1e94"              0 0 0 1 0)
            (list "negligible-at-nuclear" 0 0 0 1 0)
            (list "cosmological-constant" 1 1 1 0 0)
            (list "cole-puthoff"          0 0 0 1 0)
            (list "prigogine-conditions"  1 1 1 0 0)
            (list "orthogonal-flux"       1 0 0 0 0)
            (list "ion-coupling"          1 0 0 0 0)
            (list "plasmoid-ecton"        1 1 1 0 0)
            (list "evo-vacuum-object"     1 0 0 0 0)
            (list "water-shell-mechanism" 1 0 0 0 0)
            (list "water-car"             1 0 0 0 1)
            (list "brown-gas-tungsten"    1 0 0 0 0)
            (list "fractoemission"        1 1 1 0 0)
            (list "crater-transmutation"  1 0 0 0 0)
            (list "suppression-thesis"    0 0 0 0 0)))

    (defn zpl-lane-at (k) (eg-lane (nth (zpl-claims) k)))

    ; tally of one stratum — a fold to a scalar, never a constructed list
    (defn zpl-tally-in (cs lane)
        (if (eq (len cs) 0)
            0
            (add (if (eq (eg-lane (head cs)) lane) 1 0) (zpl-tally-in (tail cs) lane))))
    (defn zpl-tally (lane) (zpl-tally-in (zpl-claims) lane))

    (defn zpl-surface () (eg-surface (zpl-claims) 0 0))

    (let s (zpl-surface))
    (let v0  (if (eq (zpl-lane-at 0) 5) 1 0))
    (let v1  (if (eq (zpl-lane-at 2) 5) 2 0))
    (let v2  (if (eq (zpl-lane-at 3) 5) 4 0))
    (let v3  (if (eq (zpl-lane-at 7) 4) 8 0))
    (let v4  (if (eq (zpl-lane-at 10) 4) 16 0))
    (let v5  (if (eq (zpl-lane-at 5) 4) 32 0))
    (let v6  (if (eq (zpl-lane-at 9) 5) 64 0))
    (let v7  (if (eq (zpl-lane-at 11) 5) 128 0))
    (let v8  (if (eq (zpl-lane-at 12) 2) 256 0))
    (let v9  (if (eq (zpl-lane-at 16) 2) 512 0))
    (let v10 (if (eq (zpl-lane-at 17) 1) 1024 0))
    (let v11 (if (eq (zpl-lane-at 20) 2) 2048 0))
    (let v12 (if (eq (zpl-lane-at 19) 5) 4096 0))
    (let v13 (if (eq (zpl-lane-at 21) 0) 8192 0))
    (let v14 (if (and (and (eq (zpl-tally (eg-lane-measured)) 7)
                           (eq (zpl-tally (eg-lane-theory)) 7))
                      (and (and (eq (zpl-tally (eg-lane-practice)) 0)
                                (eq (zpl-tally (eg-lane-inference)) 6))
                           (and (eq (zpl-tally (eg-lane-contested)) 1)
                                (eq (zpl-tally (eg-lane-mystery)) 1)))) 16384 0))
    (let v15 (if (and (eq (eg-grown s) 14) (eq (eg-held s) 8)) 32768 0))
    (add v0 (add v1 (add v2 (add v3 (add v4 (add v5 (add v6 (add v7
      (add v8 (add v9 (add v10 (add v11 (add v12 (add v13 (add v14 v15))))))))))))))))
